Subject: [PATCH] =?UTF-8?q?build:=20native=20=E6=94=AF=E6=8C=81=20-Pnative?=
 =?UTF-8?q?Abis=20=E9=99=90=E5=88=B6=20ABI=EF=BC=9BNDK=20=E5=AF=B9?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=E9=BD=90=2028.2?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

CI 出手机包时只编 arm64-v8a，省掉另外三个 ABI 的 CMake 编译；
NDK 与电视版保持同一版本，避免同一套 CI 里装两个 NDK。
---
 build-logic/convention/src/main/kotlin/Version.kt | 2 +-
 modules/native/build.gradle.kts                   | 6 ++++++
 2 files changed, 7 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/build-logic/convention/src/main/kotlin/Version.kt b/build-logic/convention/src/main/kotlin/Version.kt
index 24773fe2..7f5857b9 100644
--- a/build-logic/convention/src/main/kotlin/Version.kt
+++ b/build-logic/convention/src/main/kotlin/Version.kt
@@ -10,7 +10,7 @@ object Version {
     const val minSdk = 28
     const val targetSdk = 36
 
-    private const val defaultNdkVersion = "27.0.12077973"
+    private const val defaultNdkVersion = "28.2.13676358"
     private const val defaultCMakeVersion = "3.28.0+"
 
     fun getNdkVersion(): String {
diff --git a/modules/native/build.gradle.kts b/modules/native/build.gradle.kts
index 4a94a74b..b04e18bf 100644
--- a/modules/native/build.gradle.kts
+++ b/modules/native/build.gradle.kts
@@ -6,6 +6,12 @@ android {
     namespace = "moe.ouom.neriplayer.nativebridge"
 
     defaultConfig {
+        // 本机构建用：-PnativeAbis=arm64-v8a 可只编指定 ABI，避免把 x86/armeabi 也全编一遍
+        (project.findProperty("nativeAbis") as String?)?.let { abis ->
+            ndk {
+                abiFilters += abis.split(",").map { it.trim() }.filter { it.isNotEmpty() }
+            }
+        }
         externalNativeBuild {
             cmake {
                 cppFlags += listOf("-fexceptions", "-frtti")
-- 
